  "notes": [
    "Only synthetic workbook data and a synthetic file-write boundary are used. Real Office import/export, document host and spreadsheet editor run in the browser.",
    "The final browser inputs, assertions and deadlines are unchanged from the corrected baseline replay; reports are outside Vite watched roots.",
    "The archived candidate source backup is intentionally excluded: Studio product source remains only in its private submodule.",
    "The host-only pass still had blank numeric canvas cells. Real screenshots caught the gap; paint regressions were added without weakening expectations.",
    "The Core paint change touches only the display payload and preserves cached formatting and intentionally empty display text."
